ction": "Created the item"}}, {"sprintId": "178933000000080014", "itemId": "178933000000079001", "auditId": "178933000000088001", "activity": 12, "extusername": "", "actionby": "178933000000002007", "display": "Item Completed from In progress to Done", "action": 3, "addedvia": "", "actiontime": "2026-09-23T13:07:23.500Z", "entity": 3, "displayprop": {"display": "{0} {1} {100} {101}", "values": {"0": "from", "1": {"title": "In progress"}, "100": "to", "101": {"title": "Done"}}, "action": "Item Completed"}}, {"sprintId": "178933000000080014", "itemId": "178933000000079001", "auditId": "178933000000085011", "activity": 4, "extusername": "", "actionby": "178933000000002007", "display": "Updated description from Projects placeholder to facilitate further developmentGoalSeeder.php to Touchpoint Platform Migration & Feature Development Summary1. Architecture & Foundation EngineeringAgentic Vertical Slice Architecture: Established modular monolith architecture with strict slice isolation, context caging, and synchronous event dispatching (apps.core.events.EventDispatcher).Horizontal Backend Foundation (apps.core): Implemented reusable base models (TimestampMixin, BaseModel), standardized JSON response envelopes, global exception handling, and response formatters.Horizontal Design System & UI Components: Built a unified Tailwind CSS design system with brand primary blue tokens (blue-600), full dual dark-mode parity, advertising pill-tabs navigation, and reusable base UI components (BaseAlert, BasePagination, BaseButton, BaseInput, BaseSelect, BaseCard, BaseConfirmModal, BaseDateRangePicker).2. Authentication, User & Client Management SlicesAuthentication & 2FA (apps.authentication): JWT token authentication, secure session handling, login/register flows, password reset, and Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) with OTP verification.User & Role-Based Access Control (apps.user_management): User directory, profile settings, and permission role gates.Multi-Tenant Client Hierarchy (apps.client_management, apps.client_accounts): Multi-tenant account model linking Clients →→ Client Accounts →→ Projects →→ Campaign Groups →→ Campaigns.Account Integrations (apps.account_management): Network connection dashboards and OAuth credential management for Meta and Google Ads.3. M", "action": 2, "addedvia": 0, "actiontime": "2026-09-22T12:25:16.036Z", "entity": 3, "displayprop": {"display": "{0} {1} {100} {101}", "values": {"0": "from", "1": {"title": "Projects placeholder to facilitate further developmentGoalSeeder.php"}, "100": "to", "101": {"title": "Touchpoint Platform Migration & Feature Development Summary1. Architecture & Foundation EngineeringAgentic Vertical Slice Architecture: Established modular monolith architecture with strict slice isolation, context caging, and synchronous event dispatching (apps.core.events.EventDispatcher).Horizontal Backend Foundation (apps.core): Implemented reusable base models (TimestampMixin, BaseModel), standardized JSON response envelopes, global exception handling, and response formatters.Horizontal Design System & UI Components: Built a unified Tailwind CSS design system with brand primary blue tokens (blue-600), full dual dark-mode parity, advertising pill-tabs navigation, and reusable base UI components (BaseAlert, BasePagination, BaseButton, BaseInput, BaseSelect, BaseCard, BaseConfirmModal, BaseDateRangePicker).2. Authentication, User & Client Management SlicesAuthentication & 2FA (apps.authentication): JWT token authentication, secure session handling, login/register flows, password reset, and Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) with OTP verification.User & Role-Based Access Control (apps.user_management): User directory, profile settings, and permission role gates.Multi-Tenant Client Hierarchy (apps.client_management, apps.client_accounts): Multi-tenant account model linking Clients →→ Client Accounts →→ Projects →→ Campaign Groups →→ Campaigns.Account Integrations (apps.account_management): Network connection dashboards and OAuth credential management for Meta and Google Ads.3. M"}}, "action": "Updated description"}}, {"sprintId": "178933000000080014", "itemId": "178933000000079001", "auditId": "178933000000085007", "activity": 18, "extusername": "", "actionby": "178933000000002007", "display": "Updated end date from 2026-09-18T21:59:00.000Z to 2026-09-23T21:59:00.000Z", "action": 2, "addedvia": 0, "actiontime": "2026-09-21T12:17:02.329Z", "entity": 3, "displayprop": {"display": "{0} {3} {100} {103}", "values": {"0": "from", "100": "to", "3": "2026-09-18T21:59:00.000Z", "103": "2026-09-23T21:59:00.000Z"}, "action": "Updated end date"}}, {"sprintId": "178933000000080014", "itemId": "178933000000079001", "auditId": "178933000000085008", "activity": 10, "extusername": "", "actionby": "178933000000002007", "display": "Updated duration from 11d 23h 59m to 16d 23h 59m", "action": 2, "addedvia": 0, "actiontime": "2026-09-21T12:17:02.329Z", "entity": 3, "displayprop": {"display": "{0} {1} {100} {101}", "values": {"0": "from", "1": {"title": "11d 23h 59m"}, "100": "to", "101": {"title": "16d 23h 59m"}}, "action": "Updated duration"}}, {"sprintId": "178933000000080014", "itemId": "178933000000079001", "auditId": "178933000000085001", "activity": 13, "extusername": "", "actionby": "178933000000002007", "display": "Item Moved from 26 August - 9 September to 10 September - 24 September", "action": 3, "addedvia": "", "actiontime": "2026-09-21T12:16:43.700Z", "entity": 3, "displayprop": {"display": "{0} {2} {100} {102}", "values": {"0": "from", "100": "to", "2": {"title": "26 August - 9 September", "url": "#P2/sprintdetails/SP11"}, "102": {"title": "10 September - 24 September", "url": "#P2/sprintdetails/SP12"}}, "action": "Item Moved"}}, {"sprintId": "178933000000080014", "itemId": "178933000000079001", "auditId": "178933000000083001", "activity": 18, "extusername": "", "actionby": "178933000000002007", "display": "Updated end date from 2026-09-09T21:59:00.000Z to 2026-09-18T21:59:00.000